Rips_UpdateStake
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert.
├── when the stake does not exist
│   └── it should revert.
├── when the stake is deleted
│   └── it should revert.
├── when entry cap is not a power of two
│   └── it should revert.
├── when tiers is empty
│   └── it should revert.
├── when tiers exceeds max tier count
│   └── it should revert.
├── when a tier has min payout greater than max payout
│   └── it should revert.
├── when tiers are not sorted by count descending
│   └── it should revert.
├── when total payout count does not equal entry cap
│   └── it should revert.
├── when total payout pool does not equal entry cap times entry price
│   └── it should revert.
├── when fee percent exceeds FEE_BASE
│   └── it should revert.
├── when the config is valid
│   ├── it should update the config immediately.
│   └── it should emit a {StakeUpdated} event.
└── when the next rip is created after an update
    └── it should use the new config for the new rip.
